Package: figma-app
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: libqt6webenginecore6, libqt6webenginewidgets6, qt6-gtk-platformtheme
Maintainer: Robert <robert@elementary.os>
Description: Standalone Figma Web App Wrapper
 A lightweight wrapper for Figma using Chromium's app mode.
 Supports pinch-to-zoom on touchpads and modern Elementary OS 8 features.
